{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toggle Tile is a puzzle game that has you changing the color of tiles in a 3 by 3 grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to change the color of all the tiles. Each tile has a 3 by 3 grid of icons inside it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each icon acts on the corresponding tile in the puzzle. Click on a tile to apply all its effects at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160170/extras/shift.gif?t=1742561827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiles can act on themselves, creating a dynamic board state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160170/extras/self_rotate.gif?t=1742561827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features a restart button...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160170/extras/lock.gif?t=1742561827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features 100 puzzles, a level editor and workshop integration.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, a PVP mode. One player plays as dark while the other as light.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Solved 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160170/8aa2442ec6ff6940ae7e806b20d2d1f25f0ffe7e.jpg"},{"name":"Solved 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160170/ebcaa81837ea442fd5dfb3f9aced6f744e603a55.jpg"},{"name":"Solved 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160170/738793889dd358d1324c9ed17c53dee3c7590b7c.jpg"},{"name":"Solved 5 tainted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160170/0a068cfd3ee5ed194c3b0fb1675422ba332685fc.jpg"}