":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3165730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toggle Tile is a puzzle game that has you changing the color of tiles in a 3 by 3 grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to change the color of all the tiles. Each tile has a 3 by 3 grid of icons inside it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each icon acts on the corresponding tile in the puzzle. Click on a tile to apply all its effects at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160170/extras/shift.gif?t=1742561827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiles can act on themselves, creating a dynamic board state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160170/extras/self_rotate.gif?t=1742561827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features a restart button...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160170/extras/lock.gif?t=1742561827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features 100 puzzles, a level editor and workshop integration.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, a PVP mode. One player plays as dark while the other as light.</p>","developers":["Eyal Hazor"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160170/header.jpg?t=1742561827","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04.4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 94 MB availab